/// block. The function returns the (possibly new) list head.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801abb40` at `0x801ABB40` (172 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801abb40_FUN_801abb40.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `head`: current first block, or 0.
/// - `block`: block to insert.
///
/// # Returns
/// The head of the free list after insertion.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Rewrites prev/next links and block sizes; coalesced blocks are unlinked.
///
/// # Safety
/// `block` must be a writable block header and the list must be
/// address-ordered with no cycles.
