/// free object. The object found is unlinked from its old pool, inserted at the
/// head of the requested pool, stamped with the packed word at `+0x0C` (which
/// installs `callback` at `+0x10`), given `owner` at `+0x14`, reset by
/// [`fn_801a2e30`], and returned. A `+0x38` state of 1 first sets `+0x20 = 1`;
/// a non-null `+0x10` callback is then invoked with the object.
