/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80196B90` at `0x80196B90` (52 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80196b90_FUN_80196b90.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `manager`: sound-manager object.
/// - `enable`: non-zero to clear both delay words.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0x944` and `+0x948`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `manager + 0x942..+0x948` must be writable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the two branches and the increment are explicit.
