/// # Arguments
/// - `_mode`: first word, unused in the exported body.
/// - `out`: destination for the clamped level.
/// - `value`: source level.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `*out`; calls `0x80260860` and `0x802610B0` for the mode word.
///
/// # Safety
/// `out` and `value` must be readable/writable floats.
///
/// # Confidence
