// `0x8019D480` (2,052 bytes) is the one large table body this pass also lands;
// `0x8019F490` was the only skip at the time (the export keeps a single call
// plus an infinite loop after removing eleven blocks); wave 114 reconstructs it
// from the instruction words, see the section at the end of this file.
