/// block (the `mffs` above clobbers it) and then stores the 32 paired singles
/// into `+0x1C8 + 8i` with `psq_st`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801acc00` at `0x801ACC00` (296 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801acc00_FUN_801acc00.c`
