/// This is the variant the exception path uses: `mfmsr` / `ori 0x2000` /
/// `mtmsr` / `isync` first, then the same 32-double, FPSCR and 32-paired-single
/// snapshot as [`fn_801acc00`], without the owner-bit store.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801ad3b0` at `0x801AD3B0` (300 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801ad3b0_FUN_801ad3b0.c`
