// | `0x80308A00` | `0x80308A08..0x80308A3C` | player/sound base cue group |
// | `0x80308A40` | `0x80308A48..0x80308A7C` | base cue group installed by the constructors |
// | `0x80308A80` | `0x80308A88..0x80308B34` | 44-slot actor table |
