// null), keeps the count at `+0x54`, six `{handle, weight}` pairs at `+0x74`,
// and identifies a live handle by the word at `+0x9C`. Slots 1-6 and 9 are
// shared by all three 14-slot tables; slots 0, 7, 8, 10, 11, 12 and 13 are
// per-table.
